{"schema_version":2,"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","events":[{"id":"shaodi-e-o044a","title":"改元嘉平","accounts":[{"id":"shaodi-e-o044a-account","label":"《三少帝纪》正文","text":"改元嘉平","evidence":["shaodi-e-o044a-q"]}],"participants":[],"place":null,"time":{"year":249,"label":"乙丑","precision":"year","basis":"逐条核对本篇纪年及所引释年；未换算公历日。","chronology":"shaodi-y249","dating_review":{"reviewed":true,"anchor":"shaodi-q-o043","basis":"乙丑"},"evidence":["shaodi-e-o044a-q","shaodi-q-o043","shaodi-q-o046","shaodi-q-b-33155276d789f594176b"]},"ordering_evidence":"shaodi-e-o044a-q","source_order":[4,182,"O044a"],"order":1057}],"persons":[],"evidence":[{"id":"shaodi-e-o044a-q","section":"chapter-004","block":"b-d51fc505270d9cb833b5","layer":"original","quote":"夏四月乙丑〖8〗，改年。丙子〖9〗，太尉蒋济薨。","section_title":"三少帝纪第四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0013_split_000.xhtml","index":181,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":24,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"shaodi-q-b-33155276d789f594176b","section":"chapter-004","block":"b-33155276d789f594176b","layer":"modern","quote":"〖13〗二年：嘉平二年（公元 250）。","section_title":"三少帝纪第四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0013_split_000.xhtml","index":198,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":"n-235bc158a4eae2a0609a","start":0,"end":20,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"shaodi-q-o043","section":"chapter-004","block":"b-b1c990928436e9ed43da","layer":"original","quote":"嘉平元年春正月，甲午〖1〗，车驾谒高平陵。﹝一﹞太傅司马宣王奏免大将军曹爽、爽弟中领军羲、武卫将军训、散骑常侍彦官〖2〗，以侯就第。戊戌〖3〗，有司奏收黄门张当付廷尉〖4〗；考实其辞，爽与谋不轨。又尚书丁谧、邓飏、何晏，司隶校尉毕轨，荆州刺史李胜，大司农桓范，皆与爽通奸谋〖5〗，夷三族。语在《爽传》。丙午〖6〗，大赦。丁未〖7〗，以太傅司马宣王为丞相；固让，乃止。﹝二﹞","section_title":"三少帝纪第四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0013_split_000.xhtml","index":180,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":186,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"},{"id":"shaodi-q-o046","section":"chapter-004","block":"b-8bc97b77985c9cc83eeb","layer":"original","quote":"二年夏五月〖13〗，以征西将军郭淮为车骑将军〖14〗。","section_title":"三少帝纪第四","source":{"file":"OEBPS/Text/titlepage_0013_split_000.xhtml","index":183,"anchor":null},"source_sha256":"b0f2c19b3dce18a6d6e6148b6c0c6dd9332e1ab1a6357578003e333bc0a14a28","note_id":null,"start":0,"end":27,"offset_unit":"unicode_code_point"}],"profiles":{},"directory_counts":{}}
